Vendored UI components

frontend/src/components/ui/animated-counter.tsx and
frontend/src/components/ui/bell-glyph.tsx are derived from Rare UI, and the task
list treatment in frontend/src/components/chat/plan-checklist.tsx is rebuilt from
its task-list component:

  Rare UI          https://github.com/swamimalode07/rare-ui          MIT
                   Copyright (c) 2026 Swami Malode

Copied rather than installed because the project distributes its components with
`shadcn add`, which writes a file into the tree. Each file says in its own header
what was changed and why.

